Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:26:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/43] Open Bilibili's face verification page when going live
 requires it

When startLive answers with a face-verification requirement, the dock
opens Bilibili's own pre-live verification page (the entry point v0.1.2
and the Windows client use) in a window whose WebKit store is
non-persistent and seeded with the current session cookies. "Verified,
retry" retries Go live. Only whether a voucher was present is logged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
